53	
54	- One central class that receives the event and performs every reaction itself: the code moved, the coupling did
55	  not.
56	- The source still builds the content of some reactions and only delegates the others.
57	- The listener list is created inside the class that dispatches the events, so adding a listener still means editing
58	  it.
59	- Only some events go through listeners, and others are still handled by direct calls.
60	
61	## Neighbors
